# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# Local secrets — NEVER commit. The only credential in this demo is the
# optional LLM API key (see docs/threat-model.md "the last static credential").
#
# The pattern: the real .env stays local and is ignored; the committed
# template is .env.example. Copy it and fill it in:
#     cp .env.example .env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

